thon/initconfig.c's config_get_stdio_errors and"] [199 1 "// pylifecycle.c's create_stdio): PYTHONIOENCODING=ENCODING[:ERRORS] (ignored under -E and -I) forces the encoding and"] [200 1 "// the errors of stdin and stdout; stderr's errors stay backslashreplace. Without ERRORS they are strict, and"] [201 1 "// surrogateescape when no encoding is forced and the locale (LC_ALL, else LC_CTYPE, else LANG) is C or POSIX, as the"] [202 1 "// coerced C locale's. An unset locale keeps strict (pyi has no coercion to model)."] [263 1 "// writeStr is TextIOWrapper.write's encoding: utf-8 with strict errors as before, else the codec of PYTHONIOENCODING"] [264 1 "// and the stream's errors handler (a UnicodeEncodeError for an error left strict)."] [268 19 "// reconfigure()'s (queue 286)"] [286 1 "// The site module's exit and quit (site.py's Quitter; _sitebuiltins): calling one raises SystemExit(code)."] [316 1 "// startOrigArgv is sys.orig_argv: bin/pyi python passes the executable and its command line in PYI_ORIG_ARGV (joined"] [317 1 "// by the unit separator), read once and removed from the environment."]] :go/pos {:name [1 9] :package [1 1]} :go/semis [[45 12] [45 25] [85 59] [108 63] [118 57] [139 60] [148 54] [156 64] [161 65] [176 34] [181 7] [181 30] [187 39] [219 41]]} (go/file "builtins_sys_info.go" :imports [


